        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.10.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mathayo 10:38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.14.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luka 14:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha achiiha kundi ra atu na anafundzie, achiaambira, “Yeyesi amendzaye kukala mfuasi wangu ni lazima ariche njiraze, akale tayari kugaya kpwa kutsukula msalabawe, na anilunge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.10.39"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mathayo 10:39",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.17.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luka 17:33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.12.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Johana 12:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana yeyesi ndiyelonda kuokola maishage himu duniani andaangamiza maishage ga kare na kare, ela aangamizaye maishage ga himu duniani kpwa sababu yangu na kpwa sababu ya kutangazira atu habari zangu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8:35",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Chiyunani chinaamba,",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "kpwa ajili ya injili.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " andagaokola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana indafwahani mutu achiphaha utajiri wosi wa dunia ndzima, ela rohoye yiangamike? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama mutu anaweza kulavya chitu chani chikale badili ya uzima? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phundzani mwimwi atu ayi a chivyazi hichi msiokala aaminifu. Mmanye kukala mimi, Mutu Yela Mlunguni, ndakpwedza phamwenga na malaika, na utukufu ulao kpwa Baba. Mutu yeyesi ndiyenionera waibu, na kuonera haya maneno gangu wakati hinyu, nami nindamuonera haya wakati ndiphokpwedza.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
